          "blockId": "landing-ia-header",
          "html": "<div class=\"lp-section home-page\" data-landing-section=\"header\"><a class=\"skip-link sr-only\" href=\"#main\">Pular para o conteúdo</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\" data-copy-section=\"brand\">\n  <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n    <a href=\"#main\" class=\"logo\" aria-label=\"Página inicial\">\n      <span class=\"logo-mark logo-mark-duck\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span data-copy=\"brand.name\">Brand</span>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"header-center-nav\" data-header-center-nav>\n      <nav class=\"nav\" id=\"siteNav\" aria-label=\"Navegação principal\"><a href=\"#hero\">Home</a><a href=\"#services\">Landing pages</a><a href=\"#services\">Agentes de automação</a><a href=\"#pilares-blog\">Conteúdo</a><a href=\"#services\">Dashboards</a></nav>\n\n      <div class=\"header-more\" data-header-more>\n        <button class=\"header-menu-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"headerMoreMenu\" data-header-menu-button>Mais</button>\n        <div class=\"header-more-menu\" id=\"headerMoreMenu\" data-header-more-menu><a href=\"#how-it-works\">Como funciona</a><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"#lead\">Diagnóstico</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"header-actions\" data-header-actions>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-accent\" href=\"#final-cta\">Solicitar diagnóstico</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n</div>"
